    "text": "If the domain of the function $f(x)=\\sin ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{x-1}{2 x+3}\\right)$ is $\\mathbf{R}-(\\alpha, \\beta)$, then $12 \\alpha \\beta$ is equal to :",
